{"id":"54826de3b846056d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nerode-quotient-notation.md","title":"nerode quotient notation","display":"df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation","display":"df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-nerode-quotient-notation","73-definition-3.1"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§3.4, Theorems 3.9–3.10, pp. 65–71; minimum-state count distinguished from minimum pumping length","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f41b3be50448ef3b\" href=\"?note=f41b3be50448ef3b\" title=\"73-df-language-residual-equivalence\">73-df-language-residual-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nerode-quotient-notation</span><span>73-definition-3.1</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.4, Theorems 3.9–3.10, pp. 65–71; minimum-state count distinguished from minimum pumping length"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f41b3be50448ef3b\" href=\"?note=f41b3be50448ef3b\" title=\"73-df-language-residual-equivalence\">73-df-language-residual-equivalence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{index}\">\\(\\mathrm{index}\\)</span> 只作用于本环境的右同余关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_L\">\\([x]_L\\)</span> 是下述等价类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_Ly\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_Ly\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:x\\equiv_Ly\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\coloneqq|\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:x\\equiv_Ly\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\coloneqq|\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f41b3be50448ef3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f41b3be50448ef3b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$、$x,y\\in\\Sigma^*$；$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{index}","display":false},{"tex":"[x]_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_Ly\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:x\\equiv_Ly\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\coloneqq|\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\}|","display":true}],"bytes":1930,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nerode-quotient-notation|nerode quotient notation]]"},{"id":"69901fc0f2bc2a70","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\equiv_L,\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)$ 见 [[73-df-nerode-quotient-notation]]；$\\mathrm{DFA},L(M),\\mathrm{REGULAR}$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["f41b3be50448ef3b","0a6da8c909717780"]}